cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use climasus+ Studio in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "climasus+ Studio"
abstract: >-
  Visual pipeline studio for building and running health, climate, and
  environmental analyses from DATASUS, chaining climasus4r R functions
  as a node graph without writing R code. Ships with an embedded R engine.
type: software
authors:
